// Cells: the ground plan, then SilViberCity's buildings and props as stamps
// (games/silice/gfx/SilViberCity.ron, original art).
// Ground plan: - night street (General 35, flat dark), . sidewalk slabs, c cables on the sidewalk,
// p q P Q the Place Stroboscope's light-up floor (2x2), T t Y y the towers (2x2, the city's edge),
// L street lamps with loudspeakers (the foot; the lamp is stamped over it and the cell above), l broken ones (the Jardin des Neons), s signs, f the garden's
// fence, g lawn (General 1), h phosphorescent tall grass, b the sector barrier (closed).
// The connection strips stay on primary metatiles (the neighbours draw these cells with their own
// secondary): the south belt (rows 26-31) seen from Route S3 is lawn, street, the sign S (General
// 3), trees (! # % &) and the canal (General water 3 4 5 6); the east strip (x 33-39, rows 5-31)
// seen from Route S4 is a wood around the street; the barrier stands at x 32, out of it.
